{"thread":{"threadID":3831,"boardID":166,"topic":"TTT Maps","time":1475603445,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","lastPostTime":1475673614,"lastPoster":"BlackFire","replies":3,"views":375,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":1},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":50586,"threadID":3831,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"TTT Maps","time":1475603445,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1475611171,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo Dream,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>heute mal ein kleines Update für den Map Pool des TTT Servers.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>*Neu*<br>ttt_chess_and_tea<br>ttt_gunkanjima<br>ttt_hoodrat<br>ttt_manor_night_v2<br>ttt_tunnel_v2<br>ttt_waterpark_v3_pg</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hier der Download <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> : <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ifwg5iz67sjxt54/TTT.7z?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">TTT Maps</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Viel Spaß mit den Maps!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mfg ifZ4ne</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50589,"threadID":3831,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1475609427,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Neue Maps sind dringend nötig auf TTT.<br>Langsam langweilig immer die selben Maps zu spielen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50590,"threadID":3831,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1475611447,"lastEditTime":1475612450,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":1812,"editor":"Mike","likes":[{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1475674330,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Also die chess hat mind. einen Buggy spawn bei dem man unter der Map spawnt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Die gunkanjima ist schön gemacht, allerdings meiner Meinung nach sehr grpß (zu groß)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hoodrat ist ne schöne map (zu viel gamma <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> ) aber sonst top</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Manor: Nichts zu meckern. Super Gewinn (bei mir sind da nur leider Geiseln drin)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>tunnel: Auch ne schöne map, allerdings ein paar Texturenfehler (unter der Wendeltreppe kann man durch die Treppe schauen)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Waterpark ist ne Super map</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50614,"threadID":3831,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"","time":1475673614,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","time":1475680660,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/3835-update-05-10-16/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Update 05.10.16</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>/Close</p>","polls":[]}]}